        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-measurement-local-critical-load-ratio-in-the-fresh-repair-callus-p-c-loc-p-c-sqrt-rho>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-measurement-log-log-quarter-power-foundation-scaling-exponent-alpha-lambda-c-ei-k-alpha>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-measurement-repair-scar-index-at-the-adult-margin-delta-w-dmg-w-ctrl-w-ctrl-healing-completeness>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-measurement-subcritical-compressive-load-negative-control-amplitude-p-p-c-0-65-1-vs-wild-type>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-measurement-supercritical-pitchfork-rib-amplitude-correlation-across-p-p-c-sweep>,
